<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES V VICTORIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES V VICTORIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>WANGARATTA, Australia 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the</p>
<p>close of play on the second day of a four-day match between West</p>
<p>Indies and Victoria on Friday.</p>
<p>Victoria first innings 354</p>
<p>West Indies first innings</p>
<p> S.Campbell lbw b Jones		   80</p>
<p> R.Samuels c Harvey b Reiffel	    1</p>
<p> A.Griffith b Harvey			13</p>
<p> B.Lara hit wicket b Saker		86</p>
<p> C.Hooper c Berry b Harvey		49</p>
<p> J.Adams not out			    43</p>
<p> C.Browne not out			   19</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-11 w-2 nb-6)	    21</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets, 90 overs)  312</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-15, 2-51, 3-180, 4-214, 5-256.</p>
<p>To bat: I.Bishop, N.McLean, K.Benjamin, P.Thompson.</p>
<p>Bowling: Reiffel 16-7-34-1 (nb-6), Fleming 18-5-62-0, Saker</p>
<p>19-7-47-1, Harvey 21-3-56-2 (w-2), Stacey 10-1-74-0, Jones</p>
<p>6-2-26-1.</p>
